# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit eda96fb on excavador-turing/tpi, released as v1.4.0:
# `cooling set --hold` and `--auto` from v1.3.0, and v1.4.0 removes `tpi
# metrics show|rotate` and `config export --with-secrets`, both of which
# commanded a metrics token the daemon no longer has.
#
# Measured 2026-09-09 with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container: `make
# tpi-source` reported got 111dda56 against a zeroed expectation, then
# re-run to confirm it fetches and verifies cleanly.
